# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT.
#
# This repository is public, but the working method behind it is not published:
# product strategy, pricing hypotheses, engineering workflow, debugging
# practice, architecture decision records and phase planning all stay local.
#
# README.md is the single published document. To publish any other markdown
# file, add an explicit negation below — deliberately, one file at a time.
#
# NOTE: these files exist only in this worktree once ignored. Git-ignored is
# not backed up. Keep replicated copies outside the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.md
!/README.md

# The agent operating rules are workflow too, and settings.json is not markdown
# so the rule above does not reach it. To publish them, delete this line.
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Next.js
# next-env.d.ts is generated by `next dev` / `next build` / `next typegen`;
# Next.js documents it as git-ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.next/
/out/
/build/
.turbo/
next-env.d.ts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TypeScript
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Testing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/coverage/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vercel/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Migrations are reviewable artifacts and are COMMITTED.
# Nothing under drizzle/ is ignored — this note exists so nobody adds it later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
